        "title": "Dolly Parton's Imagination Library",
        "link": "https://imaginationlibrary.com/",
        "description": "<p>With today's news, I thought I'd share this great program:<p>“When I was growing up in the hills of East Tennessee, I knew my dreams would come true. I know there are children in your community with their own dreams. They dream of becoming a doctor or an inventor or a minister. Who knows, maybe there is a little girl whose dream is to be a writer and singer.<p>The seeds of these dreams are often found in books and the seeds you help plant in your community can grow across the world.”</p>\n<hr>\n<p>Comments URL: <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50234474\">https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50234474</a></p>\n<p>Points: 164</p>\n<p># Comments: 26</p>",
